                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "q3oDpX",
                      "name": "A good check question can be",
                      "fill": "#24231F",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A good check question can be answered in a sentence or two. It asks the learner to use the idea, not to repeat it.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Literata",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "URHBr",
                      "name": "Before explaining a result, ",
                      "fill": "#24231F",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Before explaining a result, ask the learner to predict it. After they answer, say plainly whether it was right and why.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.6,
                      "fontFamily": "Literata",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
